<title>USA: Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</title>
<headline>Kansas feedlot cattle market quiet, no sales - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DODGE CITY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade was quiet, with no sales slaughter steers or heifers confirmed, USDA said. Inquiry moderate, demand light.</p>
<p>Sales confirmed on 81,700 head confirmed including 28,600 head or about 35 percent contracted or formulated cattle. Confirmed - none</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
